# LLM 首启种子（仅数据库为空时生效一次，之后以 web「模型供应」页配置为准）。
# 首启时会自动匹配内置供应商 profile（anthropic/openai/deepseek/智谱/kimi/minimax/
# 阿里/硅基流动/方舟/coding plan 等），key 经 $ENV 引用留在环境变量中。
# LLM first-boot seed (applied once when the database is empty; afterwards the web
# "Model Providers" page is the source of truth). On first boot the model is matched
# against the built-in provider profiles (anthropic/openai/deepseek/zhipu/kimi/minimax/
# alibaba/siliconflow/volcengine/coding plans, etc.); the key stays in environment
# variables via $ENV references. Replace the model below with one from your provider.
TIANSHU_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
TIANSHU_LLM_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
TIANSHU_LLM_API_BASE=
TIANSHU_LLM_TEMPERATURE=0.7
TIANSHU_LLM_TOP_P=1.0
TIANSHU_LLM_MAX_TOKENS=4096
# models.dev 目录价（USD）→ 记账口径（CNY）的换算汇率
# Exchange rate converting models.dev catalog prices (USD) into billing records (CNY).
TIANSHU_LLM_USD_CNY_RATE=7.2
TIANSHU_DB_PATH=.tianshu/tianshu.db
TIANSHU_HOST=127.0.0.1
TIANSHU_PORT=8000
# Runtime identity boundary. trusted-local is loopback-only by default.
TIANSHU_SECURITY_MODE=trusted-local
# secure-remote requires every value below and refuses plaintext HTTP.
TIANSHU_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=
TIANSHU_ALLOWED_HOSTS=
TIANSHU_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
TIANSHU_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS=
# Generate from a high-entropy token; store only: sha256:<64 lowercase hex>.
TIANSHU_AUTH_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN_HASH=
# Browser opaque-session lifetimes.
TIANSHU_AUTH_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS=900
TIANSHU_AUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS=2592000
# CLI/MCP clients (do not commit the token):
# TIANSHU_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# TIANSHU_API_TOKEN=
TIANSHU_WORKSPACE_DIR=.
TIANSHU_AGENT_MAX_ITERATIONS=20
TIANSHU_AGENT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=300

# 凭证加密主密钥（Fernet）：鸿胪寺外部凭证 + LLM 供应商 API key 共用 —
# 首次部署用下列命令生成，写入 .env：
#   python -c "from cryptography.fernet import Fernet; print(Fernet.generate_key().decode())"
# ⚠️ 不要用示例值；丢失此密钥则全部加密凭证不可恢复。
# ⚠️ 从旧版本升级且 llm_configs 中存有明文 key 时，迁移 0020 需要此密钥在场。
# Master encryption key (Fernet), shared by external integration credentials and LLM
# provider API keys. Generate it on first deployment with the command above and put
# it in .env.
# ⚠️ Never use an example value; if this key is lost, ALL encrypted credentials are
# unrecoverable.
# ⚠️ When upgrading from an older version with plaintext keys in llm_configs,
# migration 0020 requires this key to be present.
TIANSHU_SECRET_MASTER_KEY=
# 可选：外部网络能力 API keys（缺失时对应工具自动降级不注册）
# Optional: API keys for external network capabilities (when a key is missing, the
# corresponding tool degrades gracefully and is simply not registered).
# TIANSHU_JINA_API_KEY=
# TIANSHU_TAVILY_API_KEY=
# TIANSHU_FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=
